00:06:58","text":"不能够强调他之前能劈叉"},{"number":200,"start":"00:06:58","end":"00:07:01","text":"能身体多好好吗"},{"number":201,"start":"00:07:01","end":"00:07:03","text":"我我生气的是"},{"number":202,"start":"00:07:03","end":"00:07:05","text":"他那个才都没好"},{"number":203,"start":"00:07:05","end":"00:07:06","text":"那个利索呢"},{"number":204,"start":"00:07:06","end":"00:07:07","text":"333处骨折"},{"number":205,"start":"00:07:07","end":"00:07:08","text":"没好利索呢"},{"number":206,"start":"00:07:08","end":"00:07:10","text":"然后又天天出去"},{"number":207,"start":"00:07:10","end":"00:07:12","text":"你说你隔三差五出去一下也行"},{"number":208,"start":"00:07:12","end":"00:07:14","text":"那他的话有没有他的这个意见"},{"number":209,"start":"00:07:14","end":"00:07:15","text":"他的意见是"},{"number":210,"start":"00:07:15","end":"00:07:17","text":"我这我想出去透透气"},{"number":211,"start":"00:07:17","end":"00:07:18","text":"我亲生孩子不陪我"},{"number":212,"start":"00:07:18","end":"00:07:20","text":"你上哪说理去抱怨都不敢"},{"number":213,"start":"00:07:20","end":"00:07:21","text":"他都说过一次"},{"number":214,"start":"00:07:21","end":"00:07:23","text":"他都那么说过一次"},{"number":215,"start":"00:07:23","end":"00:07:25","text":"那说过一次了之后不给好脸"},{"number":216,"start":"00:07:25","end":"00:07:26","text":"人家不说第二回了"},{"number":217,"start":"00:07:29","end":"00:07:30","text":"迁就你呗"},{"number":218,"start":"00:07:30","end":"00:07:31","text":"疼你呗"},{"number":219,"start":"00:07:31","end":"00:07:33","text":"迁就你呗"},{"number":220,"start":"00:07:35","end":"00:07:36","text":"别说那些没用了"},{"number":221,"start":"00:07:36","end":"00:07:38","text":"伤好了之后陪她出去"},{"number":222,"start":"00:07:38","end":"00:07:40","text":"搀着"},{"number":223,"start":"00:07:41","end":"00:07:42","text":"嗯那行"},{"number":224,"start":"00:07:42","end":"00:07:45","text":"那你说就是嗯她在好了之后"},{"number":225,"start":"00:07:45","end":"00:07:47","text":"还可以继续出去溜达什么的"},{"number":226,"start":"00:07:47","end":"00:07:48","text":"都没问题呀"},{"number":227,"start":"00:07:48","end":"00:07:50","text":"哈只要有人陪着就没问题"},{"number":228,"start":"00:07:50","end":"00:07:52","t